  "title": "Guillem BC Probable NDE 4933",
  "date": "July 1997",
  "content": "Felt a great peace, a feeling of happiness and peace as I had never felt. I was happy; suddenly I started rising, first slowly, and then rapidly. At the end of the tunnel had a beautiful white light with a blue and white bicolor ring that was spinning like a roulette but slowly, the light-aired emotional warmth, wisdom. When I was very close to the light the light was understood that God and felt a force that would stop me and would not let me into the light. Then I contact the light told me: 'Not yet.' Then I started back down knowing that he returned to the living world. The light told me without words that I was still on a mission on earth, but without saying what it was. As he descended, he was proud of myself at once I knew he would never feel a sensation so pleasant in my life. I had no fear of death, almost knew it was very pleasant, although suicide was not a legitimate way to reach that state. I felt enlightened, caring, trained, even years later, mainly guided in making decisions and confident in the future. God touched me gently and with love. My soul, my mind, my being was enlightened and opened to the sensitivity, wisdom and knowledge. It was one of the best experiences of my life so far. I do not remember actually landing the descent; just my memories of that experience are completed at this point.",
